# Release signing keys every Lanternfish Gate trusts, built into the binary.
#
# One per line: lfrk1 <base64 Ed25519 public key> <comment>
# The maintainer's key comes from `scripts/sign-releases.sh keygen` (only the
# public half belongs here). To rotate, add the new key in a release signed
# with the old one, then remove the old key in a later release.
#
# Forks: replace these with your own key, or add keys per machine in
# /etc/lanternfish/release-keys.
